1
00:00:00,150 --> 00:00:02,164
You've never seen your own eyes move.

2
00:00:02,664 --> 00:00:03,642
Look in a mirror.

3
00:00:03,642 --> 00:00:05,886
Look at your left eye, then your right.

4
00:00:06,386 --> 00:00:07,980
You never see them move.

5
00:00:07,980 --> 00:00:11,301
But they do: a quick jump, several times a second.

6
00:00:11,801 --> 00:00:15,606
During each jump, your brain hides the blur and stitches the gap.

7
00:00:16,106 --> 00:00:19,241
Your phone's front camera shows you a split second late.

8
00:00:19,541 --> 00:00:21,843
So on the screen, you catch them moving.

9
00:00:22,343 --> 00:00:23,839
Now try the mirror again.
